\end{equation}
and the right side is finite when~$\rho_2<1$.
\end{corollaryA}

The same examples show that the power~$\nf{(d-1)}{(2\eta\theta)}$ in~\eqref{e.lr.bound} is optimal for every fixed~$0<\eta<2$.

