	\a\coloneqq\operatorname{diag}(1,\Theta,1,\ldots,1)\qquad\mbox{and}\qquad u(x)\coloneqq\exp(\sqrt\Theta\,x_1)\cos x_2\,,
\end{equation*}
whose coarse ellipticity ratio is~$\Theta$. For this solution,
