a map $g$ with base $β$.
There is a family of circle diffeomorphisms $φ \co E × 𝕊^1 → 𝕊^1$ such
that each $γ_x ∘ φ_x$ has average $g(x)$ and $φ_x(0) = 0$.
\end{lemma}

